2026-06-05 17:21:10.513 | DEBUG  | logging:callHandlers:1737 | Submitting callback functools.partial(<built-in method run of _contextvars.Context object at 0x31ec43fc0>, <bound method Embedder._embed_sync of <src.embedder.Embedder object at 0x1320a3b60>>, '[REVISED SUSTAINABLE AGRICULTURE TRAINING GUIDE_2026 Cover + back.docx - PREFACE]\nHistorically, Uganda, like many nations, has practiced traditional agriculture in harmony with nature. However, to meet the needs of a growing population, programs encouraged the use of chemical fertilizers to increase yields, which sometimes had negative impacts on soil and consumer health. Today, to reverse this trend, many countries, including Uganda, are turning to more sustainable agricultural practices, which has led to improved organic exports and farmer incomes. The Ugandan government actively supports this transition through programs aimed at improving agricultural production, soil health, and the adoption of sustainable scientific techniques.', False) with args () and kwargs {} to thread worker queue
